# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are logged here, day by day.

## Day 1 — 2026-08-29
### Added
- `index.html` — the complete billing app in a single file:
  - **Billing** — search, add items to cart, live total, generate & print bill
  - **Inventory** — items with price, GST %, HSN code, and stock (auto-deducted on sale)
  - **GST invoices** — CGST + SGST split, toggleable in Settings
  - **Customers (Khata/Udhaar)** — customer records with running balance; full, partial, and credit payments
  - **UPI QR payments** — live QR code generated per bill or due amount for real UPI payment collection
  - **Expenses** — log shop expenses by category
  - **Dashboard** — today's revenue, expenses, net, items sold, top sellers, low-stock alerts (live-updating)
  - **History** — every bill saved and reprintable
- `README.md` — setup guide, project structure, and day-wise contribution log

## Day 2 — 2026-08-30
### Added
- `CHANGELOG.md` — this file, tracking day-wise history

## Day 3 — 2026-08-31
### Added
- `style.css` — all CSS extracted from `index.html` into its own file for cleaner code organization
### Changed
- `index.html` — inline `<style>` block replaced with `<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">`

## Day 4 — 2026-09-01
### Added
- `app.js` — all JavaScript logic extracted from `index.html` into its own file
### Changed
- `index.html` — inline `<script>` block replaced with `<script src="app.js"></script>`; the file is now pure markup (18 lines)

## Day 5 — 2026-09-02
### Added
- `backup.js` — export/import feature:
  - "Download backup" button (in Settings) saves all data — inventory, bills, customers, payments, expenses, shop settings — as a timestamped `.json` file
  - "Restore backup" button lets you pick a previously downloaded `.json` file and reload it, after a confirmation prompt (since it replaces all current data)
### Changed
- `index.html` — added `<script src="backup.js"></script>`
- `app.js` — Settings modal now has a "Backup & restore" section wired to the new functions

